      "writtenOn": "2017-07-11T18:15:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "After we call rt946x_select_ilmt(), the input current limit would move from the default 3.25A to whatever value defined by IAICR (which is 0.5mA by default). Ricktek said there might be an in-rush current if we enable the register-defined current limit here immediately, because the chip\u0027s internal current limit adjusts slowly.",
